{"id":"hasta","lemma":"hasta","pos":"prep","rank":99,"glosses":["until","up to, to the point of, as much as"],"ipa":"/ˈasta/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-hasta.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aguarda hasta las seis.","en":"Wait till six.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442958"},{"text":"Espera hasta las seis.","en":"Wait till six.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442959"},{"text":"Hasta ahora, todo bien.","en":"So far, so good.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735854"},{"text":"Tom comió hasta saciarse.","en":"Tom ate his fill.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799593"},{"text":"Hasta mi mamá sabe.","en":"Even my mom knows.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77955"}]}